 "section_summary": "This section contains tributes to Prince Iyesato Tokugawa, consular reporting on Japanese restrictions on shipboard radios, and reporting on Japan’s overseas shortwave broadcasts. A September 1940 broadcasting bulletin supplies listener letters, articles, transmission schedules, and programming in several languages. The section ends with the opening page of another consular despatch about Japanese radio propaganda.",
